  "summary": "I am a Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) Developer with a focus on building reliable and scalable solutions using .NET technologies. My work centers on supporting manufacturing operations by developing systems that improve efficiency, streamline processes, and ensure data accuracy across production environments.\nI have experience working with C#, .NET, and database technologies to design, develop, and maintain MES applications that integrate with broader enterprise systems. I take pride in writing clean, maintainable code and delivering solutions that align with both technical requirements and business goals.\nI am continually looking to expand my technical skill set and stay current with evolving technologies in manufacturing and software development.\nCore competencies include:\n• MES Development & Support\n• .NET / C# Development\n• Database Management (SQL)\n• System Integration & Troubleshooting\n• Process Optimization\nI am always open to connecting with professionals in manufacturing, software development, and industrial technology.",
